  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d34d9af03bd8a374c810bbfad858edf1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Info_Exhibit_Centerpiece
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Museum.Runtime::Museum.ExhibitInfo
  title: "Nh\xE0 bia l\u0103ng T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1EE9c"
  period: "1864\u20131867 (th\u1EDDi Nguy\u1EC5n)"
  material: "G\u1EA1ch, v\u1EEFa v\xE0 \u0111\xE1"
  origin: "L\u0103ng T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1EE9c (Khi\xEAm L\u0103ng), Hu\u1EBF"
  source: "Tu Duc's Tomb - Stele Building (CyArk Dataset) \u2014 Vasilis Haroupas
    (vashar) (Sketchfab), gi\u1EA5y ph\xE9p CC-BY 4.0. D\u1EEF li\u1EC7u do CyArk
    thu th\u1EADp n\u0103m 2019 b\u1EB1ng qu\xE9t laser (LiDAR) v\xE0 ch\u1EE5p \u1EA3nh
    m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t, tr\xEAn kh\xF4ng; ph\xE2n ph\u1ED1i qua Open Heritage
    3D (doi:10.26301/n06n-qa49). Tr\u01B0ng b\xE0y d\u1EA1ng m\xF4 h\xECnh thu nh\u1ECF,
    kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i k\xEDch th\u01B0\u1EDBc th\u1EADt."
  summary: "Nh\xE0 bia trong l\u0103ng vua T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1EE9c \u1EDF Hu\u1EBF,
    x\xE2y trong c\xE1c n\u0103m 1864\u20131867. B\xEAn trong \u0111\u1EB7t t\u1EA5m
    bia \u0111\xE1 kh\u1EAFc b\xE0i Khi\xEAm Cung K\xFD do ch\xEDnh nh\xE0 vua so\u1EA1n."
  story: "L\u0103ng T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1EE9c, t\xEAn ch\xEDnh th\u1EE9c l\xE0 Khi\xEAm
    L\u0103ng, l\xE0 l\u0103ng c\u1EE7a vua T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1EE9c, v\u1ECB vua th\u1EE9
    t\u01B0 c\u1EE7a tri\u1EC1u Nguy\u1EC5n. L\u0103ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c x\xE2y
    trong ba n\u0103m, t\u1EEB 1864 \u0111\u1EBFn 1867. L\u0103ng chia th\xE0nh hai
    khu: khu t\u1EA9m \u0111i\u1EC7n \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EDD c\xFAng v\xE0 khu l\u0103ng
    m\u1ED9.\n\nTheo l\u1EC7, bia \u1EDF l\u0103ng vua ghi c\xF4ng \u0111\u1EE9c
    c\u1EE7a nh\xE0 vua v\xE0 do vua k\u1EBF v\u1ECB so\u1EA1n. Vua T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1EE9c
    kh\xF4ng c\xF3 con trai, n\xEAn \xF4ng t\u1EF1 so\u1EA1n b\xE0i v\u0103n bia
    Khi\xEAm Cung K\xFD. Trong b\xE0i v\u0103n, nh\xE0 vua k\u1EC3 v\u1EC1 cu\u1ED9c
    \u0111\u1EDDi m\xECnh v\xE0 t\u1EF1 nh\u1EADn nh\u1EEFng l\u1ED7i l\u1EA7m khi
    tr\u1ECB v\xEC. T\u1EA5m bia l\u1EDBn \u0111\u1EB7t trong nh\xE0 bia n\xE0y.\n\nC\xF4ng
    tr\xECnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1ED5 ch\u1EE9c CyArk qu\xE9t 3D n\u0103m 2019,
    b\u1EB1ng m\xE1y qu\xE9t laser v\xE0 \u1EA3nh ch\u1EE5p t\u1EEB m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EA5t
    v\xE0 tr\xEAn kh\xF4ng. Qu\u1EA7n th\u1EC3 di t\xEDch C\u1ED1 \u0111\xF4 Hu\u1EBF,
    trong \u0111\xF3 c\xF3 l\u0103ng T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1EE9c, l\xE0 Di s\u1EA3n V\u0103n
    h\xF3a Th\u1EBF gi\u1EDBi c\u1EE7a UNESCO.\n\nM\xF4 h\xECnh \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thu nh\u1ECF \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1EB7t v\u1EEBa trong ph\xF2ng
    tr\u01B0ng b\xE0y."
